'''Alpacky''' (アルパッ力, ''Arupakka'', '''Alpacka''') is an [[:Category:Alien Enemies|Alien]] variant of [[Camelle]] that appears in [[Into the Future]], [[Cats of the Cosmos]] and [[Legend Stages]]. She was added in [[Version 4.5 Update|Version 4.5]].

